{
  "_readme": "这是 dsh-rofm 的主配置文件；改完保存即可，插件会在下一次用户消息/模型步骤前按文件内容自动热加载（mtime 相同也能识别；写到一半的坏 JSON 会保留上一次可用配置）。所有 *_Percent 都是百分数。注意：importance 的 α 是回忆概率乘数，调高 importance.max 或让大量文件夹拿到 0.9+ 会让它们几乎每次都被回忆，请慎重设置高重要性。归档不调用模型：新归档先以“待评分”落盘（未评分的记忆不参与回忆），由当前会话模型结合当前语境通过 memory_judge 工具提交 α（0.01~1）、β（信赖度 -10~10，不参与回忆概率，只用于提示阅读模型该回忆的可信度）与关键词。β 范围是固定常量，不提供配置项。",
  "enabled": true,
  "compress": {
    "enabled": true,
    "triggerPercent": 60,
    "compressPercent": 20,
    "contextWindowTokens": 0,
    "minContextTokens": 512,
    "minMessagesToCompress": 4,
    "minChunkChars": 200,
    "targetChunkChars": 1200,
    "maxFoldersPerRun": 100,
    "keepRecentMessages": 2,
    "maxBoundaryOvershoot": 1.25,
    "applyToSubagents": false,
    "applyToMainSessions": true,
    "preStepEnabled": true,
    "emergencyPercent": 85,
    "emergencyCompressPercent": 40,
    "maxExtraPasses": 2,
    "hardLimitPercent": 95
  },
  "importance": {
    "min": 0.01,
    "max": 1,
    "warnAbove": 0.8,
    "weights": {
      "keywords": 0.3,
      "decisions": 0.25,
      "userDensity": 0.2,
      "code": 0.1,
      "recency": 0.15
    }
  },
  "keywords": {
    "min": 3,
    "max": 8,
    "extraStopwords": [],
    "matchMode": "contains"
  },
  "recall": {
    "enabled": true,
    "firstGenMax": 10,
    "mu": 5,
    "sigma": 3,
    "maxGeneration": 0,
    "probabilityScale": 1,
    "seed": 0,
    "sort": "createdAt",
    "applyToSubagents": false,
    "applyToMainSessions": true,
    "maxRecalledBlocks": 64,
    "maxRecalledChars": 120000,
    "persistInjected": true,
    "triggerSourceKinds": ["user"]
  },
  "storage": {
    "dir": "memory",
    "perSession": true,
    "indexFile": "index.json",
    "statsFile": "stats.jsonl",
    "maxFolders": 10000
  },
  "logging": {
    "enabled": true,
    "verbose": false
  },
  "test": {
    "dryRun": false
  }
}
